 (ATOM-LISTP
  (ATOM LISTS ACL2-BUILT-INS)
  "Recognizer for a true list of [atom]s

  The predicate [47matom-listp[0m tests whether its argument is a [47m[true-listp][0m
  of [atom]s, i.e., of non-conses.

