  [47m[ld][0m special [47m[ld-skip-proofsp][0m is [47mt[0m, then the missing [events] are
  printed with a warning before the [47mdefabsstobj[0m event is admitted;
  but if [47mld-skip-proofsp[0m is the symbol [47mINCLUDE-BOOK[0m, then that
  warning is omitted.  (Also see [skip-proofs] and see
  [ld-skip-proofsp].)  If however proofs are not being skipped, then
