  Let [47mst[0m be an abstract stobj with corresponding foundational stobj
  [47mst$c[0m.  Let [47mf[0m be an exported function for [47mst[0m and let [47mf$a[0m and [47mf$c[0m be
  the corresponding [47m:LOGIC[0m and [47m:EXEC[0m functions, respectively.  The
  formals of [47mf[0m are obtained by taking the formals of [47mf$c[0m and
  replacing [47mst$c[0m by [47mst[0m.  The [guard] for [47mf[0m is derived as follows from
  the guard of [47mf$a[0m.  First, the formals of [47mf$a[0m are replaced by the
  formals of [47mf[0m in the guard of [47mf$a[0m, to obtain a term we denote here
