  Furthermore, [47mdefwarrant[0m generates the [47m[warrant][0m for [47mfn[0m.  The name of
  that 0-ary function will be [47mAPPLY$-WARRANT-fn[0m.  Calls of [47m[apply$][0m
  on [47m'fn[0m in proof attempts can only be simplified if the warrant
  hypothesis, [47m(APPLY$-WARRANT-fn)[0m, [3maka[0m ``the warrant,'' is among the
  hypotheses of the conjecture being proved.  The warrant specifies
  the values of both [47m(badge 'fn)[0m and [47m(apply$ 'fn ...)[0m, including the
  tameness requirements imposed on [47mapply$[0m.  (The warrant explicitly
