  Alternatively, consider using the ACL2-Doc Emacs browser; see
  [ACL2-Doc].

    Examples:
    ACL2 !>:doc DEFTHM          ; print documentation of DEFTHM
    ACL2 !>:doc logical-name    ; print documentation of LOGICAL-NAME

    General Form:
