  Note that links are always printed with respect to the [47m\"ACL2\"[0m package
  (that is, as though the current package were [47m\"ACL2\"[0m).  So for
  example, a link to the present topic will be displayed as [47m[doc][0m,
  not as [47m[acl2::doc][0m, regardless of the current package or the
  package of the topic being displayed.  Such links can thus take you
  to topics in the ACL2-Doc Emacs browser (see [ACL2-Doc]).

