  signature is empty or not), [47mencapsulate[0m exports the results of
  evaluating its non-[47m[local][0m [events], but its [47m[local][0m [events] are
  ignored for the resulting logical [world].

  The result of a non-trivial [47mencapsulate[0m event is an extension of the
  logic in which, roughly speaking, the functions listed in the
  [signature]s are constrained to have the [signature]s listed and to
