  which [47m[getprop][0m is used for system programming, with
  [47m'current-acl2-world[0m as the (implicit, for [47mgetpropc[0m) world-name.

  [31;1mMacro: [0m<getpropc>

    (defmacro getpropc (symb key &optional
                             default (world-alist '(w state)))
