 (HEADER
  (ARRAYS ACL2-BUILT-INS)
  "Return the header of a 1- or 2-dimensional array

    Example Form:
    (header 'delta1 a)

    General Form:
    (header name alist)

  where [47mname[0m is arbitrary and [47malist[0m is a 1- or 2-dimensional array.
  This function returns the header of the array [47malist[0m.  The function
  operates in virtually constant time if [47malist[0m is the semantic value
  of [47mname[0m.  See [arrays].

  [31;1mFunction: [0m<header>

    (defun header (name l)
      (declare (xargs :guard (or (array1p name l) (array2p name l))))
      (prog2$ name (assoc-eq :header l)))")
 (HEAVY-LINEAR-P
