        goal then the indicated [induction] is applied to the goal
        and the [47m:do-not-induct[0m hint is inherited by all subgoals
        generated.

    [47m:[0m[47m[instructions][0m

        [47mValue[0m is a list of interactive [proof-builder] instructions; see
        [instructions].  Unlike other hint keywords described here,
        this one is actually a custom keyword hint (see
        [custom-keyword-hints]) that generates a suitable
        [47m:[0m[47m[clause-processor][0m hint.

