        [47mValue[0m is any object.  This hint does nothing, except that if [47mvalue[0m is
        non-[47mnil[0m then the usual ``[Note: A hint was supplied...
        Thanks!]'' is not printed.

    [47m:nonlinearp[0m

        [47mValue[0m is [47mt[0m or [47mnil[0m, indicating whether [non-linear-arithmetic] is
