  that completion is reached, the [47m:in-theory[0m keyword remains
  associated with the [47m(enable foo)[0m in the hint settings, although of
  course there is no re-installation of the theory at any ensuing
  child goal.  When finally [47m\"Subgoal 3\"[0m and its descendants have been
  completed and the prover is about to consider [47m\"Subgoal 2\"[0m, the
  [47m:in-theory[0m association is removed from the hint settings and the
  global theory is re-installed.  However, the list of pending hints
  remains empty.

