    ; But the [47m(consp b)[0m hypothesis is not really necessary in
    ; ACL2's type-free logic because [47m(cdr b)[0m is [47mnil[0m if [47mb[0m is
    ; not a [47mcons[0m.  For the reasons explained in the tutorial, we
