  function symbol of arity [47mni[0m and [47mgi[0m is a function symbol, a macro
  alias for a function symbol [47mgi'[0m (see [macro-aliases-table]) in
  which case we treat [47mgi[0m as [47mgi'[0m, or a pseudo-lambda expression of
  arity [47mni[0m.  An instantiable function symbol is any defined or
  constrained function symbol except the primitives [47m[not][0m, [47m[member][0m,
  [47m[implies][0m, and [47m[o<][0m, and a few others, as listed by the constant
  [47m*non-instantiable-primitives*[0m.  These are built-in in such a way
