  no proof obligation.  However, the restriction applies from (5)
  above that the functions [47mfi[0m are instantiable; when that fails, then
  the replacement of each [47mfi[0m by [47mgi[0m will not take place.

  Finally, note that an optional second argument to
  [47m:termination-theorem[0m specifies an explicit functional substitution
