 (LOGIC-TERMP
  (TERMP ACL2-BUILT-INS)
  "Recognizer for [term]s that call only [47m:[0m[47m[logic][0m-mode function symbols

  This predicate strengthens [47m(termp x wrld)[0m, as it also requires
  [47m(logic-fnsp x wrld)[0m, i.e., that every function symbol called in [47mx[0m
