    (defun ghi (fn lst)
      (declare (xargs :guard (and (apply$-guard fn '(nil))
                                  (true-listp lst))))
      (cond
        ((endp lst) nil)
        (t (cons (apply$ fn (list (car lst)))
                 (ghi fn (cdr lst))))))

  The three events are executed without error and [47msq[0m and [47mghi[0m are
  admitted in [47m:logic[0m mode.  By the way, we're naming certain
  functions in these reviews with consecutive letters of the
  alphabet, e.g., [47mabc[0m, [47mdef[0m, [47mghi[0m, [47mjkl[0m, [47mmno[0m, etc.  These names are not
  mnemonic or acronyms.  Don't read anything into the names!  Note
