  and the [47m:guard[0m on the new line [2'].  The latter includes [47m(natp
  (car loop$-gvars))[0m.

  If we think in terms of scions, we're saying ``Every time this [47mlambda[0m
  object is applied, its two formals must satisfy the conjunction
  beginning at line [2'].''

  Finally, how do we know every application of the [47mlambda[0m by the fancy
  scion [47mappend$+[0m (line [0]) will satisfy this guard?  We know from
  the definition of [47mappend$+[0m that every application supplies the
