  "Informal Semantics of [47mFOR[0m [47mLoop$[0ms


LP5: Informal Semantics of [47mFOR[0m [47mLoop$[0ms

  The value returned by a [47mFOR[0m [47mloop$[0m can be specified as follows --- but
  we hasten to add that this is not how Common Lisp compilers
  implement [47mloop$[0m!  We think this description is easier to
  understand.

  The first step in evaluating a [47mFOR[0m [47mloop$[0m is to determine the range of
  each iteration variable by evaluating the target expressions as
  previously described.

  Next, repeat the following steps until the process stops.  (1) If any
  range is empty, stop.  (2) Otherwise, assign each iteration
  variable the first value in its range and shorten the range by one,
  by removing that first element.  (3) If the [3muntil-expr[0m evaluates to
  non-[47mnil[0m under the current values of the global and iteration
  variables, stop.  Otherwise, if the [3mwhen-expr[0m evaluates to non-[47mnil[0m
  under the current values of the variables, then evaluate the
  [3mbody-expr[0m under the current values.  Otherwise, do not evaluate the
  [3mbody-expr[0m.

  When the repetition stops, the [3mbody-expr[0m will have been evaluated [3mn[0m
  times, each time producing a value [3mvali[0m, 0 <= [3mi[0m < [3mn[0m, where the [3mvali[0m
  are listed in the order in which they were produced.  The result
  returned by the [47mloop$[0m is determined by the operator, [3mop[0m, of the
  [47mloop$[0m as follows.

    * [47mSUM[0m          --- return the sum of the [3mvali[0m

    * [47mCOLLECT[0m --- return [47m(LIST [0m[3mval1[0m ... [3mvaln[0m[47m)[0m

    * [47mAPPEND[0m   --- return [47m(APPEND [0m[3mval1[0m ... [3mvaln[0m[47m)[0m

    * [47mALWAYS[0m   --- return [47m(AND [0m[3mval1[0m ... [3mvaln[0m[47m T)[0m

    * [47mTHEREIS[0m --- return [47m(OR [0m[3mval1[0m ... [3mvaln[0m[47m)[0m

  Note that if [3mop[0m is [47mALWAYS[0m, iteration can stop the first time a [3mvali[0m
  is [47mnil[0m.  Similarly, if [3mop[0m is [47mTHEREIS[0m, iteration can stop the first
  time a [3mvali[0m is non-[47mnil[0m.  Note also that an [47mALWAYS[0m [47mloop$[0m returns [47mNIL[0m
  or [47mT[0m but a [47mTHEREIS[0m [47mloop$[0m returns [47mnil[0m or the first non-[47mnil[0m value
  produced by the evaluation of the body.

  Now go to [lp-section-6] (or return to the Table of Contents (see
  [LP-SECTION-0])).")
