  of recursion.

    (defun arglistp1 (lst)
      (declare (xargs :guard t))
      (cond ((atom lst) (null lst))
            (t (and (legal-variablep (car lst))
                    (arglistp1 (cdr lst))))))

  Why is [47marglistp1-loop$[0m a little less efficient than [47marglistp[0m?

