    Rules: NIL
    Time:  0.01 seconds (prove: 0.00, print: 0.00, other: 0.01)
     *FOO*
    ACL2 !>*foo*
    109707
    ACL2 !>:pe *foo*
               2:x(DEFINE-WORLD-LENGTH-CONSTANT *FOO*)

    >              (DEFCONST *FOO* 109707)
    ACL2 !>(length (w state))
    109713
    ACL2 !>(define-world-length-constant *bar*)

