 (MIN
  (NUMBERS ACL2-BUILT-INS)
  "The smaller of two numbers

  [47m(Min x y)[0m is the smaller of the numbers [47mx[0m and [47my[0m.

  The [guard] for [47mmin[0m requires its arguments to be rational ([real], in
  ACL2(r)) numbers.

  [47mMin[0m is a Common Lisp function.  See any Common Lisp documentation for
  more information.

  [31;1mFunction: [0m<min>

