  In this example, we expect the current goal to follow from lemmas
  [47mlemma-1[0m, [47mlemma-2[0m, and [47mlemma-3[0m together with rules [47mf1[0m and [47mf2[0m and
  some obvious facts about built-in functions (such as the
  [definition] of [47m[implies][0m and the [47m:[0m[47m[executable-counterpart][0m of
