  (LISTS ACL2-BUILT-INS)
  "Final segment of a list

  [47m(Nthcdr n l)[0m removes the first [47mn[0m elements from the list [47ml[0m.

  The following is a theorem.

    (implies (and (integerp n)
                  (<= 0 n)
                  (true-listp l))
