  {IMAGE} (see [The_End_of_the_Proof_of_the_Associativity_of_App])

    Subgoal *1/1 (see [Overview_of_the_Expansion_of_ENDP_in_the_Base_Case])
    (IMPLIES (ENDP A)
             (EQUAL (APP (APP A B) C)
                    (APP A (APP B C)))).

