  This section of the online [documentation] contains notes on the
  changes that distinguish successive released versions of ACL2.

  Each topic [47mnote-x-y[0m is a note describing what in ACL2 version X.Y was
  new in comparison to the preceding version of ACL2.

  The current version of ACL2 is the value of the constant [47m(@
  acl2-version)[0m.


Subtopics

