  [47m(remove-duplicates '(1 2 3 2 4))[0m is equal to [47m'(1 3 2 4)[0m.  The
  optional keyword, [47m:TEST[0m, has no effect logically, but provides the
  test (default [47m[eql][0m) used for comparing [47mx[0m with successive elements
  of [47mlst[0m.

