  Note: This is an event!  It does not print the usual event [summary]
  but nevertheless changes the ACL2 logical [world] and is so
  recorded.  It is [47m[local][0m to the book or [47m[encapsulate][0m form in which
  it occurs; see [set-default-hints!] for a corresponding non-[47m[local][0m
  event.

    General Form:
    (set-default-hints lst)

  where [47mlst[0m is a list.  Generally speaking, the elements of [47mlst[0m should
  be suitable for use as [47m[computed-hints][0m.

  Whenever a [47m[defthm][0m or [47m[thm][0m command is executed, the default hints
  are appended to the right of any explicitly provided [47m:[0m[47m[hints][0m in
