  (LISTS STRINGS ACL2-BUILT-INS)
  "Substitute into a string or a list, using [47m[eql][0m as test

  [47m(Substitute new old seq)[0m is the result of replacing each occurrence
  of [47mold[0m in [47mseq[0m, which is a list or a string, with [47mnew[0m.

  The guard for [47msubstitute[0m requires that either [47mseq[0m is a string and [47mnew[0m
  is a character, or else: [47mseq[0m is a [47m[true-listp][0m such that either all
  of its members are [47m[eqlablep][0m or [47mold[0m is [47meqlablep[0m.

