  see [memoize].  An exception is that as with [47m[memoize][0m, [47mfn[0m may
  evaluate to the name of a macro that is associated with such a
  function symbol; see [macro-aliases-table].

  Calls of this macro generate events of the form [47m(table memoize-table
  fn nil)[0m.  When successful, the returned value is of the form [47m(mv
