 (UNMONITOR
  (BREAK-REWRITE)
  "To stop monitoring a rule name

    Examples:
    (unmonitor '(:rewrite assoc-of-app))
    :unmonitor (:rewrite assoc-of-app)
    :unmonitor :all

    General Forms:
    (unmonitor rune)
    (unmonitor :all)

