  The requirement is thus as follows.  Consider attachment of [47mg[0m to a
  constrained function [47mf[0m, where [47mg[0m may lead to updating
  [47mwith-global-stobj[0m calls that bind stobjs [47mw1[0m, [47mw2[0m, ..., [47mwk[0m, and also
  [47mg[0m may lead to [47mwith-global-stobj[0m calls that bind, in addition to the
  [47mwi[0m, stobjs [47mr1[0m, [47mr2[0m, ..., [47mrn[0m.  Then the signature of [47mf[0m must specify a
  value [47m(r . w)[0m for the keyword [47m:GLOBAL-STOBJS[0m, where [47mr[0m and [47mw[0m are
  lists of stobjs such that: [47mw[0m includes all [47mwi[0m, and the union of [47mr[0m
  and [47mw[0m includes all [47mri[0m.")
