  the proof-builder, which corresponds to submitting [47m:doc
  acl2-pc::rewrite[0m directly to the ACL2 loop.")
 (ACL2-PC::DROP
  (PROOF-BUILDER-COMMANDS PROOF-BUILDER-COMMANDS-SHORT-LIST)
  "(primitive) drop top-level hypotheses

    Examples:
    (drop 2 3) -- drop the second and third hypotheses
    drop       -- drop all top-level hypotheses

    General Forms:
    (drop n1 n2 ...) -- Drop the hypotheses with the indicated indices.

